# Documentation

- Spec/design/impl are the contract. Code follows `docs/IMPLEMENTATION.md` slices.
- Do not invent Workday-specific drivers or LiteLLM-specific APIs in docs.
- Examples use fake origins (`example.edu`, `ex.test`) and `[REDACTED]` — never
  live cookies or keys.
- When behavior changes, update SPEC + IMPLEMENTATION in the same change.
- Keep ISP port names identical to `packages/core/src/ports/`.
